  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Heating of 2-chloro-1-phenylbutane with <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mrow></math> gives <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math> as the major product. Reaction <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math> with <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mrow></math> followed by <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> gives <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></math> as the major product. <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></math> is:</p>"
  },
